  "content": "<h2>星雲光效 (紅色)</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><h5>(這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗)</h5><h5>將原本普通的附魔物品與盔甲光效改為酷炫的暗紅色星雲光效，在黑暗中效果尤為驚艷！請在遊戲輔助設定中將「光效強度」調整至100%以獲得最佳效果。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p>請將本資源包放入resourcepacks資料夾，並在遊戲內的資源包選單中啟用。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/776/2024-05-10_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j58K0FVWknU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
